#: ../../AIDE/About/FlocHH.rst:12
msgid "Flocculator HH Configurable Component"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/FlocHH.rst:21
msgid "Flocculator"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/FlocHH.rst:21
msgid "The flocculator use baffles to create a flow path with 180˚ bends. The flow contracts as it goes around the bend, expands, generates turbulence, and then deforms the fluid as viscosity converts the turbulent kinetic energy into heat. The fluid deformation causes collisions between particles."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/FlocHH.rst:25
msgid "The flocculator has three design constraints:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/FlocHH.rst:27
msgid "Deform the fluid so there are sufficient collision opportunities for particles."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/FlocHH.rst:28
msgid "Maintain a flow expansion geometric ratio (flow width to distance between expansions) that is greater than 4."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/FlocHH.rst:29
msgid "Limit the velocity gradient so that flocs can grow large enough to be captured by the plate settlers in the clarifier."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/FlocHH.rst:32
msgid "Generate New Models of the Flocculator"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/FlocHH.rst:34
msgid "Edit the configurations to create new models of the flocculator. Some models may fail because the constraints can't all be met. Send us `feedback to share how you are using the flocculator HH model, to give us suggestions for how to make these models easier to use, and to <https://forms.gle/cqDPapYkcSmLnDu4A>`_ |reportabug|."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/FlocHH.rst:0
msgid "reportabug"
msgstr ""

